# Reproduce the pristine tree with:
#   pio pkg install --global --library m5stack/M5EPD@0.1.5
# (it lands in ~/.platformio/lib/M5EPD). Only these four files differ;
# examples/, tools/, .piopm and .clang-format were deleted wholesale.

