+// --- MicroPatterns LOCAL ADDITION: 1bpp push ------------------------------
+//
+// WHY THIS IS NOT JUST "pushCanvas() with a different bpp".
+//
+// The IT8951 applies SetRotation() while it LOADS an image (the rotate field
