+// i.e. a canvas COLUMN is a panel ROW, with the column order reversed.
+//
+// FAILURE MODE IF THE REVERSAL IS BACKWARDS: the image appears rotated 180
+// degrees (upside down and mirrored), sharp and correct otherwise. Fix by
+// replacing `(_iwidth - 1 - cx)` with `cx` in the ROTATE_90 branch below --
+// do not go looking anywhere else.
